  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Strengthen Cargo Security and Trade Facilitation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para el Fortalecimiento de la Seguridad de la Carga y Facilitacin del Comercio Exterior</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecer y optimizar las capacidades de supervisin y control de las entidades competentes sobre el manejo y movimiento de las mercancas de comercio exterior que entran, salen y transitan por el territorio nacional, as como sobre los medios en que se transportan, con el fin de incrementar la seguridad, facilitar el comercio legtimo, reducir costos transaccionales en las operaciones de comercio exterior y elevar la competitividad de la economa nacional.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen and optimize the supervision and control capabilities of the competent entities over the management and movement of foreign trade goods that enter, leave and transit through the national territory, as well as the means in which they are transported, in order to increase security, facilitate legitimate trade, reduce transactional costs in foreign trade operations and increase the competitiveness of the national economy.</narrative>
  </description>
